The shapes of libstdc++'s and libc++'s std::vector deduction, header-free.
CBMC skipped a deduction guide with more parameters than arguments,
tried the guides of a braced list only with the elements as arguments
(deducing vec<int, int> for {1, 2, 3}), did not find a class template of
an inline namespace by its qualified name, and reported the template-id
`lib::vec<int>' in sizeof as ambiguous with the guide.
